@format 1
@id queue.create-edit-work
@title Create active edit work
@area Queue
@entry input
@summary Create edit work from the active media and current Crop and tone state, then preserve tab and relay lineage in the schedule.
@flow TB
@related queue.create-saved-edit-work, queue.add-work

@alias ui = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LEdit
@alias edit = Cadroue.Application.LEdit
@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule

[input] Edit tab requests current work <input>
- Receive the active source, duration, Crop state, tone state, output preset, and relay routing @ ui.LEditDescribe(...)
- Convert the output preset into an edit work description @ ui.LEditDescribe(...)
> build

[build] Build active edit item <decision>
- Validate the source and create a safe output path @ edit.LEditItemsCreate(...)
- Create one work item with the current Crop and video state @ edit.LEditWorkCreate(...)
? "No valid item is created" > rejected
? "An item is created" > persist

[persist] Add durable work <storage>
- Add the item with relay target and source lineage @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
- Record the queue result @ ui.LEditDescribe(...)
> result

[result] Active edit queued <output>
= The worklist contains the current edit plan for the active media.

[rejected] Nothing queued <error>
= No edit work record is added.
